---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Shop | RISK ON">
  <Header activeNav="shop" />
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-skin-base">RISK ON SUPPLY</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-skin-base opacity-75">Built for training. Made when ordered.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-12 mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center text-sm text-skin-base opacity-80 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Every trader knows the feeling. Risk on: you're in, you're pushing, you're betting on yourself.
        Risk off: you play it safe, you sit on the sidelines. We only make gear for one mode.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3">
        Same mindset that gets you to hit a new max in the gym is the same mindset that gets you to
        bet on yourself everywhere else. No hedging. No sitting out. Just showing up and putting in the work.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-skin-line bg-skin-fill">
        <img src="/shop/hit-maxes-evade-taxes.png" alt="Hit Maxes, Evade Taxes Tee" class="aspect-square w-full object-cover" />
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-4">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-skin-base">Hit Maxes, Evade Taxes</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-skin-base opacity-60">For the ones who chase PRs and dodge W-2s. Soft, heavyweight cotton blend built to survive leg day and everything after.</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-skin-base opacity-70">$29.99</p>
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/4gMbJ01ER6atbxF6C82oE00" data-astro-reload class="mt-4 rounded-lg border-2 border-skin-accent px-4 py-2 text-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-skin-accent transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-skin-accent hover:text-skin-inverted">
            Buy Now
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-skin-line bg-skin-fill">
        <img src="/shop/nostoploss-mockup.png" alt="All In, No Stop Loss Tee" class="aspect-square w-full object-cover" />
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-4">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-skin-base">All In, No Stop Loss</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-skin-base opacity-60">No hedging. No sitting out. Bold statement tee built for the ones who bet on themselves.</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-skin-base opacity-70">$29.99</p>
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/5kQbJ0gzLbuN0T13pW2oE01" data-astro-reload class="mt-4 rounded-lg border-2 border-skin-accent px-4 py-2 text-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-skin-accent transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-skin-accent hover:text-skin-inverted">
            Buy Now
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-skin-line bg-skin-fill">
        <img src="/shop/vsyo-voda-front.png" alt="Vsyo Voda Tee" class="aspect-square w-full object-cover" />
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-4">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-skin-base">Vsyo Voda</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-skin-base opacity-60">Everything is water — chaos finding its calm. Thin-line graphic tee for the ones who think as hard as they train.</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-skin-base opacity-70">$29.99</p>
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/4gMcN4cjvgP7atBgcI2oE02" data-astro-reload class="mt-4 rounded-lg border-2 border-skin-accent px-4 py-2 text-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-skin-accent transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-skin-accent hover:text-skin-inverted">
            Buy Now
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-skin-line bg-skin-fill">
        <img src="/shop/NFPA_BLACK.png" alt="Maximum Exposure Tee" class="aspect-square w-full object-cover" />
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-4">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-skin-base">Maximum Exposure</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-skin-base opacity-60">Every category maxed out — risk, intensity, discipline. Hazard-label graphic tee for the ones who never dial it back.</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-skin-base opacity-70">$29.99</p>
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/aFa6oGfvH8iB7hp5y42oE03" data-astro-reload class="mt-4 rounded-lg border-2 border-skin-accent px-4 py-2 text-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-skin-accent transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-skin-accent hover:text-skin-inverted">
            Buy Now
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!--
        TO ADD A NEW DESIGN LATER:
        1. Drop the new photo in public/shop/your-file-name.png
        2. Create a new Stripe Payment Link for it
        3. Copy the entire <div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden..."> block above,
           paste it here as a sibling, and swap: image src, alt text, product name,
           price, and Stripe link href.
        The grid-cols-2 above will automatically slot it in next to the first card.
      -->
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center text-xs text-skin-base opacity-50 space-x-3">
      <a href="/terms" class="hover:underline">Terms</a>
      <span>·</span>
      <a href="/returns" class="hover:underline">Returns</a>
      <span>·</span>
      <a href="/shipping" class="hover:underline">Shipping</a>
      <span>·</span>
      <a href="/privacy" class="hover:underline">Privacy</a>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>